// Arts: weapon skills that cost FP. Every Art is a stub until WP-054 implements it; the
// validator warns on stubs. A weapon names its Art (`default_art` in weapons/), and the
// validator checks that the Art lists the weapon's class.
// Source: docs/game/04-arsenal-and-builds.md, "Arts". Schema: crates/content/src/arts.rs.
// Registry numbers: 19500-19513.
//
// The spec's "Any melee except fist" is spelled out here as the melee classes. "Toll" is one
// Art with two variants (Bell Toll for the Bellwright's Mallet, Choir Toll for the Choir
// Glaive); the variant follows from the weapon's element, so it stays one entry.
#![enable(implicit_some)]
(
  arts: [
    (id: "art_feint_step", name: "Feint Step", classes: [Dagger, StraightSword, CurvedSword, ThrustingSword, Fist], fp: 6, stub: true),
